msgid "CAB_E5_SCREEN_01"
msgstr "THANK YOU FOR PLAYING."

#. Ending 5, Theodora Lune's message, screen 2 of 10 (NARR-001 §9.5). Held until a button is pressed.
msgid "CAB_E5_SCREEN_02"
msgstr "THIS IS THEODORA LUNE. I BUILT THIS MACHINE."

#. Ending 5, Theodora Lune's message, screen 3 of 10 (NARR-001 §9.5). Held until a button is pressed.
msgid "CAB_E5_SCREEN_03"
msgstr "YOU NEVER USED THE LIGHT. YOU WERE CAREFUL."

#. Ending 5, Theodora Lune's message, screen 4 of 10 (NARR-001 §9.5). Held until a button is pressed.
msgid "CAB_E5_SCREEN_04"
msgstr "SO I CAN TELL YOU."

#. Ending 5, Theodora Lune's message, screen 5 of 10 (NARR-001 §9.5). Held until a button is pressed.
msgid "CAB_E5_SCREEN_05"
msgstr "THE HONOUR ROLL IS THE ENLISTMENT LIST."

#. Ending 5, Theodora Lune's message, screen 6 of 10 (NARR-001 §9.5). Held until a button is pressed.
msgid "CAB_E5_SCREEN_06"
msgstr "IN HERE THE DARK STAR ALWAYS LOSES. I WROTE IT THAT WAY."

#. Ending 5, Theodora Lune's message, screen 7 of 10 (NARR-001 §9.5). Held until a button is pressed.
